  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "家己鉸頭毛"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>作者：田美瑜</b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">印象中，tú結婚ê時tsūn，我bat替翁婿鉸一擺頭毛。因為伊ê頭毛真濟koh khiû，鉸頭毛了後，掃塗跤ài掃規半晡真麻煩。雖bóng，翁婿一直呵咾我鉸了真好，我lóng講，別人鉸是「一日剃頭，三日緣投」，hōo我鉸頭毛是「一日剃頭，三日giàn頭」，所以規氣去hōo別人鉸khah ē和koh輕鬆。&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">不而過，我ê兩个囡仔tuì國小到大學，in ê頭毛lóng是我鉸--ê。M̄是我ê技術tsiânn讚，是因為以早奶母ē替in鉸，換我家己tshuā ê時tsūn，第一擺hōo in去剃頭店鉸頭毛，頭家kā頭毛lu siunn短，in真bē慣勢，所以鉸頭毛就變做我ê khang-khuè--ah。其實，我lóng是普略仔鉸--一-下，tsiah-koh用拍層ê鉸刀拍層。上尾，tsiah用lu頭tsang ê家私kā毛跤lu--一-下。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">今年因為新冠病毒ê關係，歇睏日lóng bih leh厝m̄敢出門。我ê頭毛愈來愈長，逐擺吹頭毛ài半點鐘tsiah吹ē ta。尤其是上班ê時tsūn，趕時間suah吹bē焦，感覺真無方便。拄好想著前一站仔，同學傳一个影片，影片內底hip tsiok濟suí-tang-tang ê查某囡仔，按怎家己鉸頭tsang。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">上重要--ê是影片鉸頭tsang ê過程tsiânn簡單，只要你用lua̍h仔kā頭毛tsáng規tsáng，用樹奶束仔束--起-來了後，kā你ài鉸ê部份鉸--落-去就好勢好勢--ah。上尾影片內底ê suí姑娘仔kā頭毛放--落-來——Uah！M̄-nā頭毛suí-tang-tang，感覺人ê氣色mā變做tsiânn好。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">鉸頭毛竟然有hiah-nī簡單ê撇步，我當然ài家己來試看māi！我就大主大意，照影片ê方法，小掠一个大概仔十公分，用鉸刀殘殘鉸--落-去，koh用鉸刀kā頭毛尾修修--leh。鉸好了後，用鏡tuì後面照看māi，頭tsang尾真正有整齊，耳仔邊ê頭毛，mā親像刁故意koh用鉸刀鉸khah短。原來影片內底叫逐家kā頭tsang縛--起-來是有學問--ê，因為án-ne tsiah有拍層ê效果。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">Tse hōo我想起細漢囝讀大學了後，三不五時就講伊ê頭毛siunn長，想beh去剃頭毛。剃hit種上時行--ê、兩爿剃了了ê造型。我上驚用lu仔lu頭毛，因為無注意就有可能失敗，細漢囝可能mā是嫌出去hōo人剃麻煩。上尾，伊規氣家己剃頭毛，逐禮拜家己koh ài用lu仔lu--一-遍。</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">原來，阮囝是tsíng著我--ooh！</span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div><span><b>#</b></span><b>生活ê藝術&nbsp;</b><b style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</span></b></div><div style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報328期，2021年7月出刊。</b></span></div><div style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3M